          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The respective States and Union Territories complete the implementation of the National Scheme of Welfare of Fishermen.  The working and fund allocation processes are as follows."
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "bold": true,
              "text": "Step-1:"
            },
            {
              "text": " "
            }
          ],
          "type": "block_quote"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Eligible fishermen have to visit their nearest FISHCOPFED office to apply for this Government scheme for fisheries."
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "bold": true,
              "text": "Step-2:"
            },
            {
              "text": " "
            }
          ],
          "type": "block_quote"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Next, the President or Secretary of the Association will collect the contribution and forward it to the Nationalised bank accounts selected by the Director of Fisheries."
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "bold": true,
              "text": "Step-3:"
            },
            {
              "text": " "
            }
          ],
          "type": "block_quote"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Then, the State and Central Government match the fishermen’s contributions as allotted for them."
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "bold": true,
              "text": "Step-4:"
            },
            {
              "text": " "
            }
          ],
          "type": "block_quote"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Once this scheme reaches maturity, the authorities will return funds with the total accrued interest."
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
